      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-10-27_WidnesExaminer_art0036" n="art0036">
        <head>CREPE-DE-CHINE BLOUSE.%</head>
        <p>CREPE-DE-CHINE BLOUSE.%</p>
        <p>The blouse which forms the subject of our sketch • was a. dainty little- affair in mauve crepe• de-chine spotted with darkest clematis .purple. The yoke was simply a squa:e band of deep. tinted crochet work, bome-made, and worked .n "Ososilki." This was effectively edged with silk</p>
