        <head>CONSUMPTION CURED.</head>
        <p>CONSUMPTION CURED.</p>
        <p>An Interesting Case.</p>
        <p>" Navarino,' Brighton Road, Worthing." " Dear Sirs.—lt is with much pleasure I write you my experiena of Angler's Emulsion. Three years back I was pronounced to be in an advanced stage of phthisis and was told by various doctors that nothing could be done but to make me comfortable. Cod-liver oil was ordered, but in no form could I digest it. I tried different emulsions, but was not able to retain any until I was persusded to try Angler's, with the happiest results. Never once has it caused sickness. It has greatly improved my digestion, and when I get run down or my cough is bad I invariably take it. In fact, now I take no other preparation. Everyone who knew me when I was ill says I am a perfect marvel, for now I can keep about and take good walks, etc., and my building up I think is directly traceable to Anglier's Emulsion. When I stop it for a time I always find within a week or so of re-commencement that I gain weight. I think it a splendid preparation, and only wish it could be brought within the reach of all, as I am convined there must be many cases like my own where it is just the right preparation for lung troubles and indigestion when one requires something , speedy in effect and easy to take. I may add when my children see me taking it they clamour for a taste of " Mother's cream." Acknowledging with gratitude the benefit I have received, and wishing others the same results.— (Signed) (Mrs.) A. McßvaK." We have hundreds of testimonials similar to the above If you would like to try Angler's Emulsion send 3d. for postage and we will send you a free sample bottle, together with a descriptive booklet. Of chemists, Is. lid., 2s. 9d. and 4s. 6d. The Angier Chemical Co., Ltd., 32, Snow Hill, E. C.</p>
