        <head>Marriages.</head>
        <p>Marriages.</p>
        <p>ROSE—lTYKEs—October 20th at the Parish Church Warrington, by the Rev. T. W. Barber, Albert Rose to Emma Dykes. MARSHALL—MosToN—October 21e, at the Parish Church, Warrington, by the Rev. T. A. J. Ridpatl3, James Marshall to Polly Moston. LovELL—DouSEv—October 22ad, at the Parish Chul. Warrington, by the Rev. Canon Willis, Edgar Love; to Mary Ann Dorsey.</p>
